		<figcaption>RateFPV FC, both sides</figcaption>
	</figure>
	<figure>
		<a href="/uploads/articles/rate-isnt-speedybee/small-stack/sb-small-fc-top.webp"><img src="/uploads/articles/rate-isnt-speedybee/small-stack/sb-small-fc-top.webp" alt="Top of the SpeedyBee F405 Mini flight controller" loading="lazy" /></a>
