The ESCs are closer in looks this time, the differences being mostly down to component usage and decorations. The Rate ESC uses larger MCUs/FET drivers, with fancy silkscreen labels. The larger MCUs are used to support 32bit firmware, while the SpeedyBee ESCs use 8bit firmware.

